@startuml
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor khaki
    ParticipantBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
}

participant task服务 as QS order 10
entity 分布式锁Squirrel as LS order 20
database 流水DB as DB order 30

QS -> DB++: 查看是否已存在该流水（扣减 or 回滚）
return

opt 有流水记录
    QS -> QS: 消费完成
end

QS -> DB++: 写流水
return

opt 流水写入成功
    QS -> LS++: 释放扣减时加的分布式锁
    return
end
@enduml